# 🎓 C Compiler Learning - Phase 2: Codegen & x86-64 Encoding

**Status**: Phase 2/5 Complete (2026-03-16)
**Key Insight**: Direct AST→x86-64 (no separate IR stage), using encoder abstraction + fixup mechanism

